menu "AC IR Transport Test Configuration"

    config AC_IR_TEST_RX_GPIO
        int "RX GPIO for loopback edge-capture (jumper from ac_ir TX GPIO)"
        default 3
        range 0 21
        help
            Physically jumper this GPIO to the ac_ir TX GPIO (GPIO10,
            defined in ac_ir.c). It is configured as a plain
            interrupt-capable input -- not an RMT channel -- and every
            edge is timestamped with esp_timer_get_time() and dumped
            over serial for Python-side envelope reconstruction. See
            waveform_parser.py one level up in this test_apps/transport/
            directory.

endmenu
